<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE- Akzo Nobel H1 figures by segment.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Akzo Nobel H1 figures by segment.</headline>
<dateline>ARNHEM, Netherlands 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>Operating profit by business segment</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Chemicals					376  vs  324</p>
<p>    Coatings					 377  vs  274</p>
<p>    Pharmaceuticals				431  vs  383</p>
<p>    Fibres					    38  vs   60</p>
<p>    Miscellaneous debits			  10  vs    2</p>
<p>    Total (billions)			    1.21  vs 1.04</p>
<p>First-half sales by business segment</p>
<p>(billions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Chemicals				     3.89  vs  3.86</p>
<p>    Coatings					4.19  vs  3.66</p>
<p>    Pharmaceuticals			     2.18  vs  1.96</p>
<p>    Fibres					  1.79  vs  1.80</p>
<p>    Miscellaneous debits (millions)	   18  vs    16</p>
<p>    Total					  12.03  vs 11.26</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
